        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2011 Military Bowl\n- Places: Robert F. Kennedy Memorial Stadium, Washington, D.C.\n- Organizations: Northrop Grumman, NCAA, U.S. men's national soccer team\n- Topics: college football bowl games, soccer matches\n\nFacts:\n- The 2011 Military Bowl Presented by Northrop Grumman was the fourth edition of the game.\n- Robert F. Kennedy Memorial Stadium is located in Washington, D.C.\n- The U.S. men's national soccer team played 22 matches at Robert F. Kennedy Memorial Stadium from 1977 to 2013, more than at any other stadium.\n- The 2011 Military Bowl Presented by Northrop Grumman was a post-season American college football bowl game held on December 28, 2011 at Robert F. Kennedy Memorial Stadium as part of the 2011–12 NCAA bowl season.",
